# The data itself lives on the Hugging Face Hub, not in git:
#   https://huggingface.co/datasets/yuiseki/osm-japan-src-2026-08
# It is 5GB, cut from the planet file by `scripts/01..03` rather than
# edited by hand. data/README.md, data/LICENSE and data/provenance.yaml are
# tracked: they are the dataset card and its notices, not the data.
data/japan-260831.osm.pbf
data/japan-260831.osm.pbf.md5
data/japan_osm_boundary.geojson
data/parquet/

# Intermediates. tokyo-bbox-260831.osm.pbf alone is 224MB, and it is the one
# thing a rebuild has to spend 26 minutes of planet reading to produce.
tmp/

# Specific to this machine and to a sibling repository that is not public:
